WEBVTT

NOTE RJ Tech bilingual subtitles — Chinese above, English below.

1
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:14.700
先用导引线从管柱上窗口穿到下窗口。
First, feed a guide line from the upper steering-column opening to the lower opening.

2
00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:34.210
用 PVC 电工胶带将导引线与 DR 线束牢固捆绑。
Securely join the guide line to the DR harness with PVC electrical tape.

3
00:00:58.624 --> 00:01:10.624
轻拉导引线，同时缓慢把线束分支送入管柱。
Pull the guide line gently while slowly feeding the harness branches into the column.

4
00:01:14.844 --> 00:01:19.944
拉线过程中不要刮伤或磨损线束。
Do not scrape or abrade the harness while pulling it through.

5
00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:37.589
将所有分支穿出后，解除 PVC 胶带。
After all branches emerge, remove the PVC tape.

6
00:01:44.202 --> 00:01:46.402
取下导引线。
Remove the guide line.

7
00:01:59.387 --> 00:02:06.367
整理管柱下方线束，并将其卡入电池仓出线口。
Arrange the lower steering-column harness and seat it in the battery-compartment outlet.

8
00:02:24.241 --> 00:02:32.741
把接地线固定到接地螺栓上。
Secure the ground lead to the grounding stud.

9
00:02:35.831 --> 00:02:41.511
用工具将接地连接紧固到位。
Tighten the ground connection securely.

10
00:02:45.491 --> 00:02:47.791
使用随附的抱箍。
Use the supplied harness clamp.

11
00:02:54.948 --> 00:03:04.168
用 Φ16 抱箍将 DR 线束固定到螺柱上。
Secure the DR harness to the stud with the supplied 16 mm clamp.

12
00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:12.022
将抱箍固定件紧固到位。
Tighten the clamp fixing securely.

13
00:03:19.288 --> 00:03:25.388
将管柱下方的过孔胶圈压入孔位。
Seat the lower steering-column grommet in its opening.

14
00:03:29.902 --> 00:03:36.708
必要时可使用合适工具辅助，但不要损伤胶圈或线束。
Use a suitable tool if needed, without damaging the grommet or harness.

15
00:03:54.603 --> 00:04:06.603
按线束标签依次连接管柱上方各接插件。
Connect the upper steering-column plugs one by one according to the harness labels.

16
00:04:08.203 --> 00:04:16.103
前刹分支连接左刹车，后刹分支连接右刹车。
Connect the front-brake branch to the left brake and the rear-brake branch to the right brake.

17
00:04:19.503 --> 00:04:30.253
仪表分支连接中央仪表显示器。
Connect the instrument branch to the center display.

18
00:04:32.788 --> 00:04:37.188
左开关分支连接左侧开关。
Connect the left-switch branch to the left-hand switch.

19
00:04:39.148 --> 00:04:47.343
熄火开关分支连接红色熄火开关。
Connect the stop-switch branch to the red stop switch.

20
00:04:50.548 --> 00:04:58.548
油门线连接右手油门把手线束。
Connect the throttle lead to the right-hand throttle harness.

21
00:05:18.993 --> 00:05:26.493
将电门锁线从管柱侧孔穿入。
Feed the key-switch lead into the steering column through the side opening.

22
00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:39.180
从前方出线孔穿出，并与电门锁接插件对接。
Bring it out through the front opening and mate it with the key-switch connector.

23
00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:57.680
全部连接后，将接插件逐个放回管柱内。
After all connections are complete, return the connectors into the column one at a time.

24
00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:08.860
操作要轻，防止线束磨损。
Work gently to prevent harness damage.

25
00:06:26.797 --> 00:06:38.797
将上部过孔胶圈完整压入孔位，避免夹住线束。
Seat the upper grommet fully without pinching the harness.

26
00:06:56.410 --> 00:07:04.250
整理从原车拆下的前驱控制器。
Prepare the front-drive controllers removed from the vehicle.

27
00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:17.150
高压线：红色接 B+，蓝色接 B−；接线前必须核对端子标记。
High-voltage pair: red to B+ and blue to B−. Verify the terminal markings before connecting.

28
00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:37.840
按控制器上标注的扭矩紧固端子。
Tighten the terminals to the torque marked on the controller.

29
00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:54.320
动力分支：红色接 B+，黑色接 B−；再次核对端子标记。
Harness power branch: red to B+ and black to B−. Recheck the terminal markings.

30
00:08:21.985 --> 00:08:28.135
重新装好驱动器端子防尘盖。
Refit the drive-terminal protective cover.

31
00:08:54.130 --> 00:09:06.130
将驱动器低压接插件插入对应低压接口并确认锁止。
Insert the drive low-voltage plug into its matching interface and confirm it is locked.

32
00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:24.935
将旋变接插件与对应电机线束对接。
Mate the resolver connector with the corresponding motor harness.

33
00:09:30.673 --> 00:09:38.166
将右侧控制器装回前驱壳体内。
Reinstall the right-hand controller in the front-drive housing.

34
00:09:45.673 --> 00:09:53.339
从背面固定孔位锁紧控制器。
Secure the controller through the rear mounting points.

35
00:10:23.345 --> 00:10:26.645
将左侧控制器装入对应电机盒。
Install the left-hand controller in its corresponding motor housing.

36
00:10:33.385 --> 00:10:37.785
安装过程中同步整理线束，避免拉紧或摩擦。
Arrange the harness during installation to prevent tension or rubbing.
